<p>Assume a defensive mental state.</p><p>For one turn, you will fully block the next melee attack used against you with your telekinetically-wielded weapon and then strike the attacker with it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">90%, 97%, 102%, 106%, 110%</acronym> weapon damage.</p><p>At talent level 3 you will also disarm the attacker for 3 turns.</p><p>At talent level 5 you will be able to reflexively block up to one attack per turn with a <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Cunning 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">5%, 11%, 18%, 24%, 29%</acronym> chance, based on your cunning. Each trigger requires and uses 10 Psi.</p><p>This requires a telekinetically-wielded weapon.</p>